  "evidenceNotes": [
    "/lms/impact renders three different GridCardsLegacy variants (people, stats, awards); each variant appears at most once per page, so maxPerPage is 1 per variant (3 instances total on /lms/impact).",
    "Stats: the page overrides the preset header ('...for every customer', 7 words) with a 9-word heading and 'Brand one..four' labels; the preset 'Customer one..four' copy is never shown on a real route.",
    "Content: the page passes its own GRID_ROWS ('Fresh releases' body 30 words vs preset 21) plus frame=\"\" headerFrame=\"border-x\" (layout knobs, not modelled).",
    "Awards: the page passes per-card className / row className for the <=479 2-col badge layout (layout only); badges carry no copy.",
    "'Switching identity or platforms' card has plain:true (drops the body bottom margin) - styling only.",
    "pages-manifest.json / CLONE_SPEC_PAGES.md list grid-cards-legacy with no variant; code distinguishes 5 presets."
  ],
